# TASK-260822-c0rxj7 — Schema 8 rc.9 candidate evidence

## Candidate

- Repository: `relux-works/curator-spec`
- Branch: `candidate/schema-8-rc.9`
- Full commit SHA: `859727b103ed175ff214cbb64641f4686d8c6a68`
